			"notes": "## Twila Minecraft Mod\n\nThis is a beta release of the Twila mod.\n\n### Installation\n1. Download the `twila-*.jar` file.\n2. Place it in your Minecraft `mods` folder.\n3. Ensure you have the Fabric Loader, Fabric API, and Tapestry installed for Minecraft 1.21.11.\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft: 1.21.11\n- Fabric API: 0.141.3+1.21.11\n- Tapestry: 0.3.0-alpha\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/alizzycraft/TWILA/commits/v1.0.0-beta"
